    "전투가 가라앉고 모든 것이 고요해지자, 나는 그녀를 제대로 볼 수 있었다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr04.rpy:326
translate kr qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToValleyWithMarkus_8b4b3301:

    # "I’d never been this close to an orc before but having learned about them in books, it was no surprise that her skin was green and that two of her fang-like teeth were upturned and rested outside of her mouth."
    "오크를 이렇게 가까이서 본 적은 없었지만 책에서 배운 대로, 그녀의 피부가 녹색이고 송곳니 같은 이빨 두 개가 위로 향해 입 밖으로 나와 있는 건 놀랍지 않았다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr04.rpy:327
translate kr qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToValleyWithMarkus_8e8b2ad7:

    # "Half of her hair was long and black, wildly dangling down her back in a scraggly mess, while the other half of her head was shaved."
    "머리카락 반은 길고 검은색으로, 헝클어진 채 등 뒤로 거칠게 늘어져 있고, 나머지 반은 삭발되어 있었다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr04.rpy:328
translate kr qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToValleyWithMarkus_25df6ad0:

    # "She was incredibly athletic and, wearing just light desert robes, I caught glimpses of her body through the material as it shifted and moved around her shape."
    "그녀는 믿을 수 없이 운동 능력이 뛰어났고, 가벼운 사막 로브만 입고 있어서, 옷감이 그녀의 형태에 따라 움직이고 흔들릴 때마다 나는 그녀의 몸을 엿볼 수 있었다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr04.rpy:329
translate kr qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToValleyWithMarkus_ec7c9ac9:

    # "She had been hardened from war, with the occasional scar and scratch here and there, but both her face and curves gave her a femininity I hadn’t anticipated in a race known for its brutality."
    "그녀는 전쟁으로 단련되어 여기저기 간간이 상처와 긁힌 자국이 있었지만, 그녀의 얼굴과 곡선 모두 잔혹성으로 알려진 종족에게서는 예상치 못한 여성성을 주었다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr04.rpy:330
translate kr qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToValleyWithMarkus_31bc8bf1:

    # VES @ talk "What are you gawking at?"
    VES @ talk "뭘 계획하고 있어?"

