# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr04.rpy:452
translate kr qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToValleyWithMarkus_7e74d92d:

    # VES @ talk "But..."
    VES @ talk "베스가 한숨 쉬며 살짝 누그러졌다."

